t-[15px] font-medium text-stone-600 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-stone-900 cursor-pointer">MCP Server</a><a href="/pricing" class="inline-block px-3 py-2 text-[15px] font-medium text-stone-600 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-stone-900 cursor-pointer">Pricing</a><a href="/blog" class="inline-block px-3 py-2 text-[15px] font-medium text-stone-600 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-stone-900 cursor-pointer">Blog</a><a href="/docs" class="inline-block px-3 py-2 text-[15px] font-medium text-stone-600 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-stone-900 cursor-pointer">Docs</a></div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-x-4 md:gap-x-6"><div class="hidden md:block"><a href="https://app.serply.io/users/sign_in" class="inline-block px-3 py-2 text-[15px] font-medium text-stone-600 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-stone-900 cursor-pointer">Sign in</a></div><a href="https://app.serply.io/users/sign_up" class="group inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg py-2 px-4 text-sm font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 bg-brand-surface text-white hover:bg-brand-surface-hover active:bg-brand-surface-hover active:text-white focus-visible:outline-brand"><span>Get started <span class="hidden lg:inline">for free</span></span></a><div class="-mr-1 md:hidden"><div class="md:hidden"><div data-headlessui-state=""><button class="relative z-10 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center [&amp;:not(:focus-visible)]:focus:outline-none cursor-pointer" aria-label="Toggle Navigation" type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-headlessui-state=""><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 overflow-visible stroke-stone-700" fill="none" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M0 1H14M0 7H14M0 13H14" class="origin-center transition"></path><path d="M2 2L12 12M12 2L2 12" class="origin-center transition scale-90 opacity-0"></path></svg></button></div><div hidden="" style="position:fixed;top:1px;left:1px;width:1px;height:0;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0, 0, 0, 0);white-space:nowrap;border-width:0;display:none"></div></div></div></div></nav></div></header><!--astro:end--></astro-island><main class="mb-auto"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="relative pt-16 pb-12 text-center sm:pt-20 sm:pb-16 lg:pt-24 lg:pb-20"><h1 class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-stone-900 sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl"><span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-stone-900 via-stone-800 to-stone-900 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Serply pricing</span></h1><p class="max-w-2xl mx-auto mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-600 sm:mt-8 sm:text-xl lg:text-2xl">Use prepaid credits instead of a monthly subscription. Credits are deducted per successful uncached API request, and the credits you buy never expire.</p><div class="mt-8 sm:mt-10"></div></div><div class="mt-10 sm:mt-16"><div class="rounded-xl border border-brand-line bg-brand-tint p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8"><div class="grid items-center gap-6 sm:gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2"><div><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-brand-line bg-white px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-ink">Free to start</div><p class="mt-4 flex items-baseline gap-2"><span class="text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 sm:text-6xl">2,500</span><span class="text-xl font-medium text-stone-700">free credits</span></p><p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-700">Every new account starts here. No card required - 2,500 successful requests across any of the Serply APIs, to use in your first 30 days.</p></div><div class="lg:pl-8"><ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm text-stone-700"><li class="flex gap-2.5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-none rounded-full bg-brand"></span><span>No credit card required to sign up.</span></li><li class="flex gap-2.5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-none rounded-full bg-brand"></span><span>Cached responses cost nothing, so testing burns fewer credits than you would expect.</span></li><li class="flex gap-2.5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-none rounded-full bg-brand"></span><span>Same endpoints and same response shapes as the paid packs.</span></li><li class="flex gap-2.5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-none rounded-full bg-brand"></span><span>Top up only when you run out, from $5. Nothing recurring, and purchased credits never expire.</span></li></ul><a href="https://app.serply.io/users/sign_up?source=pricing-free" class="mt-6 inline-block rounded-md bg-brand-ink px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm hover:bg-brand-hover">Claim 2,500 free credits</a></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-12 sm:mt-16"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 sm:text-3xl">When the free credits run out</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600">Buy a prepaid pack sized to your usage, from $5. Purchased credits never expire.</p></div><div class="mt-10 mb-8 sm:mt-16 sm:mb-16"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><div class="flex h-full flex-col rounded-lg border border-stone-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><div class="flex-1"><h2 class="text-lg font-medium leading-6 text-stone-900">Micro Pack</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium tracking-tight text-stone-600">2,500<!-- --> credits</p><p class="mt-4"><span class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900">$<!-- -->5</span></p><div class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-500"><span class="font-semibold text-stone-700">$2.00</span> <!-- -->per 1,000 requests</div><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-stone-600">The same 2,500 credits you started with, for $5. The smallest way to keep going.</p></div><a href="https://app.serply.io/users/sign_up?source=pricing-micro%20pack" class="mt-6 block w-full rounded-md border border-transparent bg-brand-surface py-2 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-brand-surface-hover">Start free, then buy <!-- -->Micro Pack</a></div><div class="flex h-full flex-col rounded-lg border border-stone-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><div class="flex-1"><h2 class="text-lg font-medium leading-6 text-stone-900">Starter Pack</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium tracking-tight text-stone-600">10,000<!-- --> credits</p><p class="mt-4"><span class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900">$<!-- -->15</span></p><div class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-500"><span class="font-semibold text-stone-700">$1.50</span> <!-- -->per 1,000 requests</div><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-stone-600">A focused starter top-up for testing production integrations beyond the free credits.</p></div><a href="https://app.serply.io/users/sign_up?source=pricing-starter%20pack" class="mt-6 block w-full rounded-md border border-transparent bg-brand-surface py-2 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-brand-surface-hover">Start free, then buy <!-- -->Starter Pack</a></div><div class="relative flex h-full flex-col rounded-lg border-2 border-brand bg-white p-6 shadow-md"><span class="absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-brand-surface px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-white">Recommended</span><div class="flex-1"><h2 class="text-lg font-medium leading-6 text-stone-900">Growth Pack</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium tracking-tight text-stone-600">50,000<!-- --> credits</p><p class="mt-4"><span class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900">$<!-- -->49</span></p><div class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-500"><span class="font-semibold text-stone-700">$0.98</span> <!-- -->per 1,000 requests</div><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-stone-600">A practical production pack priced close to leading prepaid SERP API alternatives.</p></div><a href="https://app.serply.io/users/sign_up?source=pricing-growth%20pack" class="mt-6 block w-full rounded-md border border-transparent bg-brand-surface py-2 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-brand-surface-hover">Start free, then buy <!-- -->Growth Pack</a></div><div class="flex h-full flex-col rounded-lg border border-stone-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><div class="flex-1"><h2 class="text-lg font-medium leading-6 text-stone-900">Pro Pack</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium tracking-tight text-stone-600">500,000<!-- --> credits</p><p class="mt-4"><span class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900">$<!-- -->375</span></p><div class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-500"><span class="font-semibold text-stone-700">$0.75</span> <!-- -->per 1,000 requests</div><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-stone-600">High-volume self-serve credits with near-parity pricing against major competitors.</p></div><a href="https://app.serply.io/users/sign_up?source=pricing-pro%20pack" class="mt-6 block w-full rounded-md border border-transparent bg-brand-surface py-2 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-brand-surface-hover">Start free, then buy <!-- -->Pro Pack</a></div><div class="flex h-full flex-col rounded-lg border border-stone-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><div class="flex-1"><h2 class="text-lg font-medium leading-6 text-stone-900">Scale Pack</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium tracking-tight text-stone-600">2,500,000<!-- --> credits</p><p class="mt-4"><span class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900">$<!-- -->1,875</span></p><div class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-500"><span class="font-semibold text-stone-700">$0.75</span> <!-- -->per 1,000 requests</div><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-stone-600">A high-volume pack for sustained workloads, prepaid in one large balance.</p></div><a href="https://app.serply.io/users/sign_up?source=pricing-scale%20pack" class="mt-6 block w-full rounded-md border border-transparent bg-brand-surface py-2 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-brand-surface-hover">Start free, then buy <!-- -->Scale Pack</a></div><div class="flex h-full flex-col rounded-lg border border-stone-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><div class="flex-1"><h2 class="text-lg font-medium leading-6 text-stone-900">Max Pack</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium tracking-tight text-stone-600">10,000,000<!-- --> credits</p><p class="mt-4"><span class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900">$<!-- -->7,500</span></p><div class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-500"><span class="font-semibold text-stone-700">$0.75</span> <!-- -->per 1,000 requests</div><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-stone-600">Our largest prepaid balance, for the highest-volume self-serve workloads.</p></div><a href="https://app.serply.io/users/sign_up?source=pricing-max%20pack" class="mt-6 block w-full rounded-md border border-transparent bg-brand-surface py-2 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-brand-surface-hover">Start free, then buy <!-- -->Max Pack</a></div></div><p class="mt-6 text-center text-sm text-stone-600">Already have an account?<!-- --> <a href="https://app.serply.io/settings/billing" class="font-medium text-brand-ink underline underline-offset-2">Buy credits in Billing</a><span class="mx-2 text-stone-300" aria-hidden="true">|</span>Unused credits are refundable.<!-- --> <a href="/refund-policy" class="font-medium text-brand-ink underline underline-offset-2">Refund policy</a></p></div><div class="mb-12 sm:mb-16"><script>(()=>{var a=(s,i,o)=>{let r=async()=>{await(await s())()},t=typeof i.value=="object"?i.value:void 0,c={rootMargin:t==null?void 0:t.rootMargin},n=new IntersectionObserver(e=>{for(let l of e)if(l.isIntersecting){n.disconnect(),r();break}},c);for(let e of o.children)n.observe(e)};(self.Astro||(self.Astro={})).visible=a;window.dispatchEvent(new Event("astro:visible"));})();</script><astro-island uid="Z10DB65" prefix="r7" component-url="/_astro/CostComparisonSlider.jMXgWC77.js" component-export="default" renderer-url="/_astro/client.BsxOgvle.js" props="{}" ssr client="visible" opts="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;CostComparisonSlider&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:true}" await-children><div class="rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 sm:text-2xl">See what SERP data actually costs</h2><p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-600">Drag the slider to your monthly Google Search / SERP request volume and compare the estimated monthly cost across Serply and the other providers teams evaluate most often.</p><div class="mt-8"><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between"><label for="request-volume" class="text-sm font-semibold text-stone-700">Monthly requests</label><span class="font-mono text-lg font-bold text-stone-900">49,754</span></div><div class="relative mt-3"><input id="request-volume" type="range" min="0" max="1000" class="h-2 w-full cursor-pointer appearance-none rounded-full bg-stone-200 accent-brand" aria-valuetext="49,754 monthly requests" value="379"/><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-1/2 h-2 -translate-y-1/2"><div class="absolute top-0 h-2 w-0.5 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-stone-400/70" style="left:22.3%"></div><div class="absolute top-0 h-2 w-0.5 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-stone-400/70" style="left:37.9%"></div><div class="absolute top-0 h-2 w-0.5 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-stone-400/70" style="left:60.3%"></div><div class="absolute top-0 h-2 w-0.5 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-stone-400/70" style="left:75.9%"></div><div class="absolute top-0 h-2 w-0.5 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-stone-400/70" style="left:89.3%"></div></div></div><div class="relative mt-2 h-4 text-[10px] font-medium text-stone-400"><span class="absolute -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap" style="left:22.3%">Starter</span><span class="absolute -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap" style="left:37.9%">Growth</span><span class="absolute -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap" style="left:60.3%">Pro</span><span class="absolute -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap" style="left:75.9%">Scale</span><span class="absolute -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap" style="left:89.3%">Max</span></div><div class="mt-3 flex justify-between text-xs text-stone-400"><span>1,000<!-- -->/mo</span><span>30,000,000<!-- -->/mo</span></div></div><div class="mt-8 space-y-3"><div><div class="mb-1 flex items-baseline justify-between text-sm"><span class="font-semibold text-brand-ink">Serply<span class="ml-2 rounded-full bg-brand-tint px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-brand-ink">Lowest cost</span></span><span class="font-mono text-stone-900">$49<!-- -->/mo<span class="ml-1.5 text-xs font-normal text-stone-400">(<!-- -->$0.98<!-- -->/1,000)</span></span></div><div class="h-3 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-stone-100"><div class="h-full rounded-full bg-brand" style="width:13.517241379310343%"></div></div></div><div><div class="mb-1 flex items-baseline justify-between text-sm"><span class="font-medium text-stone-700">Bright Data</span><span class="font-mono text-stone-900">$75<!-- -->/mo<span class="ml-1.5 text-xs font-normal text-stone-400">(<!-- -->$1.50<!-- -->/1,000)</span></span></div><div class="h-3 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-stone-100"><div class="h-full rounded-full bg-stone-400" style="width:20.689655172413794%"></div></div></div><div><div class="mb-1 flex items-baseline justify-between text-sm"><span class="font-medium text-stone-700">Firecrawl</span><span class="font-mono text-stone-900">$83<!-- -->/mo<span class="ml-1.5 text-xs font-normal text-stone-400">(<!-- -->$1.66<!-- -->/1,000)</span></span></div><div class="h-3 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-stone-100"><div class="h-full rounded-full bg-stone-400" style="width:22.896551724137932%"></div></div></div><div><div class="mb-1 flex items-baseline justify-between text-sm"><span class="font-medium text-stone-700">ScraperAPI</span><span class="font-mono text-stone-900">$124<!-- -->/mo<span class="ml-1.5 text-xs font-normal text-stone-400">(<!-- -->$2.49<!-- -->/1,000)</span></span></div><div class="h-3 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-stone-100"><div class="h-full rounded-full bg-stone-400" style="width:34.3448275862069%"></div></div></div><div><div class="mb-1 flex items-baseline justify-between text-sm"><span class="font-medium text-stone-700">SerpApi</span><span class="font-mono text-stone-900">$361<!-- -->/mo<span class="ml-1.5 text-xs font-normal text-stone-400">(<!-- -->$7.25<!-- -->/1,000)</span></span></div><div class="h-3 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-stone-100"><div class="h-full rounded-full bg-stone-400" style="width:100%"></div></div></div></div><p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-600">At <!-- -->49,754<!-- --> monthly requests, Serply costs<!-- --> <span class="font-semibold text-stone-900">$49</span> - about <span class="font-semibold text-brand-ink">35<!-- -->% less</span> than the next cheapest option shown here (<!-- -->Bright Data<!-- -->).</p><div class="mt-6 border-t border-stone-100 pt-4 text-xs leading-relaxed text-stone-400">Estimates from each provider&#x27;s published self-serve pricing, checked October 2026. Serply&#x27;s rate is the cheapest pack that covers the volume; the $5 Micro pack costs more per credit, so it is not used here. Firecrawl and ScraperAPI price generic scrape credits rather than a search-specific rate, so their figures convert to an equivalent cost per 1,000 Google/SERP searches using each vendor&#x27;s own published credit multiplier for that request type. Rates beyond a vendor&#x27;s highest published tier are held flat rather than estimated. This chart is kept to a small set of the most recognized direct rivals - see our blog for the wider competitive landscape. Vendor pricing changes - confirm current rates on their sites before making a purchasing decision:<!-- --> <span><a href="https://serpapi.com/pricing" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="underline hover:text-stone-600">serpapi.com/pricing</a>, </span><span><a href="https://www.firecrawl.dev/pricing" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="underline hover:text-stone-600">firecrawl.dev/pricing</a>, </span><span><a href="https://www.scraperapi.com/pricing/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="underline hover:text-stone-600">scraperapi.com/pricing</a>, </span><span><a href="https://brightdata.com/pricing/serp" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="underline hover:text-stone-600">brightdata.com/pricing/serp</a>.</span></div></div><!--astro:end--></astro-island></div><div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8 sm:mb-12"><div class="p-6 bg-brand-tint border border-brand-line rounded-lg"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 mb-2">How credits work</h3><ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-stone-600"><li>1 credit = 1 successful uncached API request.</li><li>You only pay when you top up. There is no recurring monthly commitment.</li><li>One credit buys one request on any endpoint, including MCP tool calls. Pick a pack for the volume you expect.</li><li>Unused purchased credits stay on your account until you need them.</li><li>The 2,500 free signup credits are good for 30 days.</li></ul></div></div><div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8 sm:mb-12"><div class="p-6 bg-white border rounded-lg shadow-sm divide-stone-200 border-stone-200"><h2 class="text-lg font-medium leading-6 text-stone-900">Enterprise</h2><p class="mt-4 font-normal text-stone-600">Email us at team@serply.io for higher-volume pricing, custom limits, and enterprise procurement support.</p></div></div><astro-island uid="Z1hDpiJ" prefix="r8" component-url="/_astro/common-questions.COQKTv5q.js" component-export="CommonQuestions" renderer-url="/_astro/client.BsxOgvle.js" props="{}" ssr client="visible" opts="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;CommonQuestions&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:true}" await-children><div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12 sm:mb-24"><h2 class="mb-8 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-center text-stone-900 sm:text-4xl sm:mb-12">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class="space-y-4"><div class="overflow-hidden bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-lg shadow-sm transition-all hover:shadow-md"><button class="w-full px-6 py-5 text-left focus:outline-none" aria-expanded="false"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 pr-8">How does pricing work?</h3><svg class="flex-shrink-0 w-5 h-5 text-stone-500 transition-transform duration-200 " fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></div></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0"><div class="px-6 pb-5"><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600">Serply uses prepaid credits instead of a monthly subscription. You start with free onboarding credits, then buy additional credit packs as needed. One credit is deducted for each successful uncached API request.</p></div></div></div><div class="overflow-hidden bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-lg shadow-sm transition-all hover:shadow-md"><button class="w-full px-6 py-5 text-left focus:outline-none" aria-expanded="false"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 pr-8">What are the pricing tiers?</h3><svg class="flex-shrink-0 w-5 h-5 text-stone-500 transition-transform duration-200 " fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></div></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0"><div class="px-6 pb-5"><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600">We offer self-serve prepaid packs from 2,500 credits for $5 up to 10,000,000 credits for $7,500. The rate per 1,000 credits falls from $2.00 on the Micro pack to $0.75 on the Pro pack and above, and we can discuss custom pricing for higher volumes.</p></div></div></div><div class="overflow-hidden bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-lg shadow-sm transition-all hover:shadow-md"><button class="w-full px-6 py-5 text-left focus:outline-none" aria-expanded="false"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 pr-8">Do credits expire?</h3><svg class="flex-shrink-0 w-5 h-5 text-stone-500 transition-transform duration-200 " fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></div></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0"><div class="px-6 pb-5"><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600">Purchased credits never expire: they stay in your account until they are used, so you can top up when needed without worrying about a monthly reset. The 2,500 free credits every new account starts with are good for 30 days.</p></div></div></div><div class="overflow-hidden bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-lg shadow-sm transition-all hover:shadow-md"><button class="w-full px-6 py-5 text-left focus:outline-none" aria-expanded="false"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 pr-8">How are requests counted?</h3><svg class="flex-shrink-0 w-5 h-5 text-stone-500 transition-transform duration-200 " fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></div></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0"><div class="px-6 pb-5"><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600">Credits are deducted only for successful uncached API requests. Cached responses and failed requests do not consume prepaid credits.</p></div></div></div><div class="overflow-hidden bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-lg shadow-sm transition-all hover:shadow-md"><button class="w-full px-6 py-5 text-left focus:outline-none" aria-expanded="false"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 pr-8">Do larger packs reduce my cost per request?</h3><svg class="flex-shrink-0 w-5 h-5 text-stone-500 transition-transform duration-200 " fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></div></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0"><div class="px-6 pb-5"><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600">Up to a point. The rate drops from $2.00 per 1,000 on the Micro pack to $1.50 on Starter, $0.98 on Growth, and $0.75 on Pro. Scale and Max keep the $0.75 rate in a larger prepaid balance.</p></div></div></div><div class="overflow-hidden bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-lg shadow-sm transition-all hover:shadow-md"><button class="w-full px-6 py-5 text-left focus:outline-none" aria-expanded="false"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 pr-8">Do you offer technical support?</h3><svg class="flex-shrink-0 w-5 h-5 text-stone-500 transition-transform duration-200 " fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></div></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0"><div class="px-6 pb-5"><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600">Yes. Email team@serply.io and we typically respond within hours, not days.</p></div></div></div><div class="overflow-hidden bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-lg shadow-sm transition-all hover:shadow-md"><button class="w-full px-6 py-5 text-left focus:outline-none" aria-expanded="false"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 pr-8">How do I buy more credits?</h3><svg class="flex-shrink-0 w-5 h-5 text-stone-500 transition-transform duration-200 " fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></div></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0"><div class="px-6 pb-5"><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600">You can top up your balance from the billing section in your account whenever you need more credits. There is no plan migration or billing cycle to manage.</p></div></div></div><div class="overflow-hidden bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-lg shadow-sm transition-all hover:shadow-md"><button class="w-full px-6 py-5 text-left focus:outline-none" aria-expanded="false"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 pr-8">What payment methods do you accept?</h3><svg class="flex-shrink-0 w-5 h-5 text-stone-500 transition-transform duration-200 " fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></div></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0"><div class="px-6 pb-5"><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600">We accept all major credit cards and can set up invoicing for Enterprise customers. All payments are processed securely through our payment provider.</p></div></div></div><div class="overflow-hidden bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-lg shadow-sm transition-all hover:shadow-md"><button class="w-full px-6 py-5 text-left focus:outline-none" aria-expanded="false"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 pr-8">Can I get a refund?</h3><svg class="flex-shrink-0 w-5 h-5 text-stone-500 transition-transform duration-200 " fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></div></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0"><div class="px-6 pb-5"><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600">Yes, for what you have not used, if you ask within 30 days of the charge. A credit pack is refunded in proportion to its unused purchased credits, and a recurring plan is refunded for the current month less that month&#x27;s usage. Email team@serply.io to ask. Details are in our refund policy at serply.io/refund-policy.</p></div></div></div><div class="overflow-hidden bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-lg shadow-sm transition-all hover:shadow-md"><button class="w-full px-6 py-5 text-left focus:outline-none" aria-expanded="false"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 pr-8">Is there enterprise pricing?</h3><svg class="flex-shrink-0 w-5 h-5 text-stone-500 transition-transform duration-200 " fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></div></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0"><div class="px-6 pb-5"><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600">Yes. If you need higher volumes, custom limits, or procurement support, contact team@serply.io for enterprise pricing options.</p></div></div></div></div></div><!--astro:end--></astro-island></div></main><astro-island uid="xdmDF" prefix="r11" component-url="/_astro/footer.BzPmL51q.js" component-export="default" renderer-url="/_astro/client.BsxOgvle.js" props="{}" ssr client="visible" opts="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Footer&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:true}" await-children><footer class="py-12 bg-stone-50" aria-labelledby="footer-heading"><h2 id="foot